// Title: Tamper Windows Defender Remove-MpPreference - ScriptBlockLogging
// ID: ae2bdd58-0681-48ac-be7f-58ab4e593458
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-08-05
// Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
// Description: Detects attempts to remove Windows Defender configuration using the 'MpPreference' cmdlet
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

any where ((ScriptBlockText like "*_Remove-MpPreference*") and ((ScriptBlockText like "*_-ControlledFolderAccessProtectedFolders *" or ScriptBlockText like "*_-AttackSurfaceReductionRules_Ids *" or ScriptBlockText like "*_-AttackSurfaceReductionRules_Actions *" or ScriptBlockText like "*_-CheckForSignaturesBeforeRunningScan *")))
